              "id": "mok0072",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p style=\"max-width:820px;\">Mokhetle Attorneys Inc. (Registration No. 2014/230750/21) is a South African law firm based in Mahikeng, North West Province, delivering intelligent, solution-driven legal services to individuals, businesses, municipalities and government institutions. Since our establishment, we have built our practice on professionalism, integrity and purpose — and on achieving results that meet and exceed our clients&rsquo; expectations.</p>"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "text-editor"
